# AGENTS.md

## Project Overview

This repository extends [phenotype-governance](https://github.com/kooshapari/phenotype-governance).

## Agent Workflow

### 1. Planning
1. Read this AGENTS.md file
2. Check CLAUDE.md for project context
3. Review FUNCTIONAL_REQUIREMENTS.md if it exists

### 2. Implementation
1. Create feature branch from `main`
2. Implement with passing tests
3. Run quality gates:
   ```bash
   pheno standards check
   ```

### 3. Submission
1. Open PR with descriptive title
2. Ensure CI passes
3. Await sponsor review (@kooshapari)
4. Address feedback
5. Sponsor approves and merges

## Quality Gates

All changes must pass:
- Linter checks
- Type checks
- Unit tests
- Integration tests

## Sponsor Model

- **Owner**: @kooshapari
- **Reviewers**: @kooshapari (required)
- **Merge**: Sponsor approval required
